  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Teriyaki Madness Nutrition Calculator\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Building a Teriyaki Madness meal is not just about choosing chicken or steak. Your protein, bowl size, base, sides, and extras can all change the calories and macros in your order. The Teriyaki Madness Nutrition Calculator makes those differences easier to see before you decide what to eat.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the calculator to compare Teriyaki Madness calories, protein, carbohydrates, fat, sodium, fiber, and other available nutrition information across individual menu items. You can also combine several foods to estimate the nutrition of your complete meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.38tvlcz6c8r4\">\n<span>\n     Build Your Teriyaki Madness Meal With the Numbers in Mind\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Teriyaki Madness offers several protein choices, including chicken teriyaki, chicken breast teriyaki, spicy chicken, steak teriyaki, tofu teriyaki, orange chicken, chicken katsu, and salmon options. Many proteins are also available in different portion sizes.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That makes portion selection important. A junior bowl can have a very different nutrition profile from a regular or large serving of the same protein.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Instead of looking at calories alone, compare the complete nutrition profile of each choice. Someone trying to increase protein may make a different selection from someone primarily watching calories, carbohydrates, fat, or sodium.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.z7gzrrvhqcti\">\n<span>\n     Your Base Can Make a Big Difference\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The protein is only one part of a Teriyaki Madness bowl.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Depending on the meal, you may be choosing between options such as:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-6 ml-4 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base\">\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      White rice\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Brown rice\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Fried rice\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Noodles\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Vegetables\n     </span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     These choices can noticeably change the final calorie and carbohydrate content of your meal. Fried rice and noodles, for example, can contribute considerably more calories than a vegetable-based option.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the calculator to test different combinations before settling on your bowl.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.voexqb934q59\">\n<span>\n     Compare Protein Choices Side by Side\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     One useful way to use the calculator is to start with the protein instead of building the entire meal immediately.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Compare chicken breast teriyaki with regular chicken teriyaki, spicy chicken, steak, tofu, salmon, orange chicken, or chicken katsu. Look at how much protein each serving provides compared with its calories, carbohydrates, and fat.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chicken breast teriyaki can be particularly useful to compare when protein is a priority, while breaded or fried selections can produce a different balance of calories, fat, and carbohydrates.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     There is no single best choice for everyone. The better option depends on what you want from the meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.c71z4eb82xmw\">\n<span>\n     Do Not Forget Appetizers and Sides\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A bowl may fit comfortably within your nutrition target, but appetizers can change the total quickly.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Teriyaki Madness menu choices can include items such as chicken egg rolls, chicken potstickers, crab rangoons, and edamame.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you are ordering more than a bowl, add each item to your meal instead of judging your order from the entr\u00e9e alone. This gives you a much more realistic picture of what you are actually eating.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.2n0etgr5rt7a\">\n<span>\n     How to Use the Teriyaki Madness Nutrition Calculator\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Start by searching for the menu item you plan to order. Choose the correct portion or bowl size and add it to your meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Next, add your rice, noodles, vegetables, appetizer, or other available choices.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The calculator combines the selected items so you can review the estimated totals for the entire meal. You can then remove an item or compare another option until the meal better matches what you are looking for.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This approach is especially useful when two meals look similar on the menu but have very different nutrition totals.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.urhg3ag5h9wf\">\n<span>\n     Looking for a Higher-Protein Teriyaki Madness Meal?\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Start by comparing protein servings before choosing the rest of your bowl.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chicken breast teriyaki, chicken teriyaki, spicy chicken, steak, salmon, and tofu all provide protein, but the amount varies by protein and portion size. Larger servings can increase protein substantially, but they may also increase calories, sodium, carbohydrates, or fat depending on the item.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     After choosing your protein, compare your base separately. This makes it easier to see which part of the bowl contributes most to your final nutrition totals.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.ksw6v8psmrr6\">\n<span>\n     Trying to Keep Calories Lower?\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A lower-calorie Teriyaki Madness order does not necessarily mean skipping the foods you enjoy.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Consider comparing:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-6 ml-4 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base\">\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Junior portions with regular or large portions\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Chicken breast with higher-fat protein choices\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Vegetables with rice or noodles\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Steamed or simpler options with fried choices\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      A bowl by itself with a bowl plus appetizers\n     </span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Small changes can make a meaningful difference to the total meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The calculator lets you see that difference before ordering instead of relying on guesswork.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.ix5uhcbj1i8\">\n<span>\n     Watch Sodium Along With Calories\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Teriyaki meals can contain substantial sodium because sauces and seasoned ingredients contribute to the final total.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This means two choices with similar calories may have very different sodium values. If sodium matters to you, include it in your comparison instead of selecting food based only on calories or protein.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Checking the complete meal is particularly useful when combining a protein, base, sauce-heavy item, and appetizer.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.9cz18qq4defj\">\n<span>\n     Teriyaki Madness Nutrition FAQ\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in Teriyaki Madness?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Which Teriyaki Madness option has the 